# Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline for To-Do Application (DSO101 - Assignment 2)

##  Repository

**GitHub:** https://github.com/Surash124/surashsubba_02250372_DSO101_A1-



##  Project Overview

This is the configuration of a Jenkins CI/CD pipeline that can automatically build, test, and deploy To-Do app from Assignment 1. The pipeline automatically:

- checks out code from GitHub.
- installs dependencies
- runs unit tests with Jest
- builds the docker image and pushes to the DockerHub.

---

##  Tools Used

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Jenkins | CI/CD automation (localhost:8080) |
| GitHub | Source code hosting |
| Node.js + npm | JavaScript runtime & package management |
| Jest + Supertest | Unit testing framework |
| Docker | Containerization |
| DockerHub | Image registry |

---

##  Pipeline Stages
Checkout → Pulls code from GitHub

Install → Runs npm install in the backend

Test → Executes Jest unit tests

Deploy → Build and push the docker image to dockerHub

